      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "Circuit QED made the interaction of artificial atoms and microwave photons controllable, creating a foundational experimental platform for quantum optics and information.",
        "attribution": "Blais supplied the decisive circuit-QED formulation; Wallraff and Schoelkopf established its landmark experimental realization and development.",
        "maturity": "The methods are reproducible across laboratories and underpin a large, mature field of superconducting quantum science.",
        "uncertainties": [
