        "attribution": "Yablonovitch and John introduced foundational concepts, with Joannopoulos making seminal theoretical contributions.",
        "maturity": "The physics is established and its consequences are visible in a wide range of optical devices and experiments.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "The breadth of foundational contributors makes a three-person allocation challenging."
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "rank": 8,
